lingmo-calculator (1.0.4+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ui: replace in-window HeaderButton mode menu with a global menu bar
    entry registered via com.canonical.AppMenu.Registrar.  The calculator
    window now shows only a plain title; the "Mode" submenu with checkmarks
    appears in the compositor's status bar menu bar.  The window no longer
    imports ui/header_button.h or ui/menu.h.

