lingmo-calculator (1.0.1+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * feat: add Scientific, Programmer, Date, and Graph calculator modes.
  * Scientific mode: sin/cos/tan/log/sqrt/exp and more via HMath engine,
    with RAD/DEG angle unit switch.
  * Programmer mode: HEX/DEC/OCT/BIN bases, 64/32/16/8-bit widths,
    bitwise AND/OR/XOR/NOT/shift operations.
  * Date mode: date difference (days/months/years) and date add/subtract.
  * Graph mode: function plotter for y=f(x) with pan and zoom.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0800

